1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,970
A membership turns a purchase into access.

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:09,477
Someone buys it, becomes a member, and the content meant for members opens to them.

3
00:00:09,477 --> 00:00:14,366
This video shows how to sell a membership, keep content for members, what

4
00:00:14,366 --> 00:00:17,150
a member sees, and how memberships end.

5
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:24,744
Some of what you publish is worth paying for:

6
00:00:24,744 --> 00:00:26,740
guides, articles, downloads.

7
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,692
A membership sells access:

8
00:00:29,692 --> 00:00:32,650
for a year, for a month, or for good.

9
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:37,401
Buying it should open the door at once, and ending it should close

10
00:00:37,401 --> 00:00:40,290
it, without anyone editing user roles by hand.

11
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:48,087
A membership is a product with the Membership part.

12
00:00:48,087 --> 00:00:52,630
It names the roles members are put in, and how many days it lasts.

13
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:57,576
Content is kept for members with the Role Picker, which says which roles

14
00:00:57,576 --> 00:00:58,760
can see an item.

15
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:01,646
Buying makes the buyer a member.

16
00:01:01,646 --> 00:01:05,580
Buying again while still a member adds the days to when it ends.

17
00:01:06,330 --> 00:01:10,266
It ends on its end date, when its order is canceled or fully

18
00:01:10,266 --> 00:01:12,830
refunded, or when you choose End now.

19
00:01:17,012 --> 00:01:21,714
To try it, open Tools, Recipes, and run the Memberships sample.

20
00:01:21,714 --> 00:01:28,256
It adds a Member role, a members' article, and an Annual Membership at forty-nine dollars.

21
00:01:28,256 --> 00:01:30,232
Click Run, and confirm.

22
00:01:29,562 --> 00:01:34,631
Under Access Control, Roles, the Member role is the one members are put in.

23
00:01:34,631 --> 00:01:37,822
Add a role like this for each kind of member.

24
00:01:33,133 --> 00:01:35,618
Open the Annual Membership product.

25
00:01:35,618 --> 00:01:40,527
Under Membership, tick the roles members are in, here Member, and enter how

26
00:01:40,527 --> 00:01:42,648
many Days a membership lasts:

27
00:01:42,648 --> 00:01:47,193
three hundred sixty-five, or zero for a membership that does not end.

28
00:01:50,983 --> 00:01:55,798
To keep content for members, with Content Access Control on, give the content

29
00:01:55,798 --> 00:02:00,496
type the Role Picker part, and tick that it restricts who sees the content.

30
00:02:00,496 --> 00:02:04,325
On each item, Who can see it chooses the roles, here Member.

31
00:02:04,325 --> 00:02:06,413
Administrators see everything.

32
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:11,385
Anyone else who opens it, such as a visitor who is not signed

33
00:02:11,385 --> 00:02:13,080
in, is asked to sign in.

34
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:17,319
A signed-in user who is not a member is told they do not have access.

35
00:02:21,121 --> 00:02:26,458
Jamie opens the Annual Membership, forty-nine dollars, and adds it to the cart.

36
00:02:26,458 --> 00:02:31,921
Memberships are for an account, so buyers sign in to buy one, and then check out.

37
00:02:29,357 --> 00:02:34,981
Jamie gives the contact details and a billing address, and pays by bank transfer.

38
00:02:34,981 --> 00:02:39,507
When the money arrives and the order is paid, Jamie is a member.

39
00:02:43,407 --> 00:02:48,877
Now Jamie's account has a Memberships page, with the membership and when it ends.

40
00:02:48,877 --> 00:02:52,147
Jamie signs in again, so the new role applies.

41
00:02:51,366 --> 00:02:53,717
And the members' article opens:

42
00:02:53,717 --> 00:02:56,956
Jamie can now read what only members can see.

43
00:03:00,752 --> 00:03:04,670
Under Commerce, Memberships, you see every membership:

44
00:03:04,670 --> 00:03:08,001
who, which one, its status, and when it ends.

45
00:03:08,001 --> 00:03:12,442
Filter by Active, Expired or Ended early, or search by member.

46
00:03:07,428 --> 00:03:11,713
A membership ends on its end date, when its order is canceled, or

47
00:03:11,713 --> 00:03:14,188
when its order is refunded in full.

48
00:03:14,188 --> 00:03:16,663
To end one yourself, click End now.

49
00:03:16,663 --> 00:03:18,172
It refunds nothing.

50
00:03:18,172 --> 00:03:22,458
The membership is Ended early, and the member is taken out of the

51
00:03:22,458 --> 00:03:27,348
roles it gave them, unless another membership still gives them those roles.

52
00:03:28,542 --> 00:03:33,242
Jamie's Memberships page now shows the membership as Ended early.

53
00:03:37,442 --> 00:03:38,228
A club:

54
00:03:38,228 --> 00:03:42,222
an annual membership for guides and routes only members see.

55
00:03:42,972 --> 00:03:44,292
A publication:

56
00:03:44,292 --> 00:03:47,462
a monthly membership for premium articles.

57
00:03:48,212 --> 00:03:49,476
A course site:

58
00:03:49,476 --> 00:03:53,712
a lifetime membership, with zero days, for the whole library.

59
00:03:55,712 --> 00:04:00,382
With memberships, a purchase opens the door, and ending it closes it.

60
00:04:00,382 --> 00:04:02,002
Thanks for watching.

